From 02140df01847fbea35dea4b751d96a20a3be41ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:15:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] world.set-redstone-output and redstone_emitter blocks (round
 4 item 4, API 50)

A mod block declared "redstone_emitter": true is a signal source (wires
join it); set-redstone-output keeps a level and a strong flag in its block
entity, read by the level's signal hooks (weak to every side, direct when
strong), and updates the neighbours (and theirs when strong) on change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RYe92n7spgy8vtm4CovRWA
